This folder contains example sample plots and data from airplane-borne lidar data from boreal forest in South-East Norway from 2015, with 2 points per m2 resolution. More information about the dataset can be read here (in Norwegian): https://hoydedata.no/LaserServices/REST/DownloadPDF.ashx?projectId=416

Lidar data: Open access (c) hoydedata.no

Plots: systematic point grid specifically generated for this example task.
